{
  "id": "waterfall",
  "name": "Waterfall",
  "description": "A living gorge: a river pours over the lip as a particle simulation, breaking into spray and churning foam that drifts downstream; the flow swells with rain; mist holds a rainbow. Dippers bob on stones, swifts nest behind the fall, trout leap at dusk, a kingfisher darts past and a deer comes down to drink, under a day and night.",
  "author": "Luci Evol - www.evoldigitalproductions.com",
